WEBVTT

00:08.976 --> 00:10.688
-[grunts softly]
-[explosions]

00:17.869 --> 00:19.665
Rozé, what's your status?

00:20.165 --> 00:21.167
[Sakuya] I'm on my way.

00:24.549 --> 00:26.720
It might take some time to get there!

00:27.221 --> 00:29.392
[Ash] Understood. Be careful.

00:36.155 --> 00:38.661
[Knightmare powering up]

00:38.828 --> 00:40.247
Norland...

00:42.042 --> 00:44.046
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:14.185 --> 02:17.316
[Ash] <i>Rozé, part of the palace
has started to ascend.</i>

02:17.399 --> 02:18.944
<i>I'm going after him!</i>

02:20.990 --> 02:23.328
[Sakuya] The Apollo alone
is at a disadvantage in aerial combat.

02:23.411 --> 02:24.998
I'll follow with the Artemis.

02:25.499 --> 02:26.919
[Ash] <i>We can't miss this chance.</i>

02:30.551 --> 02:33.724
<i>We must defeat Norland at all costs!</i>

02:34.809 --> 02:35.812
Yes...

02:42.324 --> 02:44.245
[keyboard clacking]

02:48.587 --> 02:50.090
[Stanley gasps, exclaims]

02:56.435 --> 02:58.314
It wasn't supposed to be like this...

03:03.993 --> 03:05.872
[operator] We have finished
analyzing the data

03:05.955 --> 03:08.209
we just received from Neo-Britannia.

03:08.794 --> 03:11.215
The unidentified machines are called Loki.

03:11.299 --> 03:13.554
It's a new type of Knightmare Frame,

03:13.637 --> 03:17.144
designed alongside the Foulbout
as a strategic weapon.

03:17.227 --> 03:19.064
A new Knightmare Frame?

03:19.148 --> 03:20.776
[operator] It appears that

03:20.901 --> 03:23.699
all Loki worldwide are
under the Foulbout's control.

03:23.782 --> 03:26.538
The pilot is Norland von Lunebelg.

03:27.205 --> 03:29.460
Send this information
to all member nations.

03:29.544 --> 03:32.090
Request clearance
for deployment to Hokkaido!

03:32.174 --> 03:33.176
[operator] Understood.

03:34.929 --> 03:38.604
Hurry, our defenses
are nearing their limits!

03:47.622 --> 03:50.043
[Catherine] <i>It's rude
to keep a lady waiting...</i>

03:50.544 --> 03:51.838
<i>Lord Norland.</i>

03:53.174 --> 03:54.761
<i>Tell me.</i>

03:57.182 --> 03:58.811
What is the meaning of strength?

04:00.355 --> 04:01.525
<i>I need to know...</i>

04:04.864 --> 04:06.576
What do you plan to do now?

04:07.620 --> 04:09.624
There's no point in staying here.

04:09.708 --> 04:14.509
I intend to go the front shrine
and do what I can do.

04:22.315 --> 04:24.319
[device trilling]

04:34.048 --> 04:37.053
What's the matter? You're not deploying?

04:40.185 --> 04:41.563
For the next operation...

04:42.064 --> 04:44.359
I want to lead the charge
as second-in-command.

04:45.028 --> 04:46.030
Do it.

04:46.615 --> 04:48.535
[Haruka] Aren't you going to ask why?

04:49.244 --> 04:50.371
I mean...

04:50.873 --> 04:54.506
I shouldn't get special treatment
just because I'm your daughter.

04:54.589 --> 04:58.221
This is my decision as the leader
of the Seven Shining Stars.

04:58.304 --> 05:00.100
Nothing more, nothing less.

05:04.149 --> 05:05.443
-Sir--
-Haruka.

05:06.403 --> 05:07.740
Promise me

05:08.241 --> 05:09.869
you'll come back alive.

05:12.290 --> 05:13.417
Yes, sir!

05:30.661 --> 05:32.915
[grunts]

05:32.999 --> 05:38.384
I... admired... your strength!

05:42.935 --> 05:47.485
Prove to me that the strength
I believed in...

05:48.739 --> 05:50.158
wasn't false!

05:57.548 --> 05:59.051
[Catherine] <i>What?</i>

05:59.134 --> 06:01.305
<i>Did you just cut my energy supply?</i>

06:01.806 --> 06:04.019
<i>This the same tactic used at Situmpe...</i>

06:05.648 --> 06:07.442
That's just plain cheating.

06:07.526 --> 06:10.073
It's got nothing to do with strength.

06:10.156 --> 06:13.412
Are you... not even taking me seriously?

06:13.997 --> 06:17.588
<i>Come on, Lord Norland,
this isn't what I wanted...</i>

06:17.672 --> 06:20.803
<i>I wanted a real fight!</i>

06:20.886 --> 06:22.598
Silence, vermin.

06:32.325 --> 06:34.162
[sighs heavily]

06:35.415 --> 06:36.626
Thought as much...

06:42.178 --> 06:44.141
[Sakuya panting]

06:44.224 --> 06:45.853
That took way too much time.

06:46.478 --> 06:47.648
I've got to hurry.

06:52.323 --> 06:54.829
Ash, I've just launched the Artemis.

06:55.329 --> 06:56.624
What's your status?

06:57.668 --> 06:59.797
[Ash] <i>I haven't reached the summit yet.</i>

06:59.881 --> 07:00.883
[Sakuya] <i>Roger that.</i>

07:02.302 --> 07:04.306
[♪ ominous music playing]

07:14.786 --> 07:17.332
Moving on to the next phase.

07:26.141 --> 07:28.145
[crackling, thrumming]

07:39.334 --> 07:42.132
[first officer] Captain,
the Situmpe Barrier is approaching!

07:42.215 --> 07:43.593
[captain] Lower altitude!

07:43.677 --> 07:46.140
[first officer] The barrier is
moving too fast! We can't avoid it!

07:47.350 --> 07:48.562
Systems are down!

07:48.645 --> 07:51.316
[captain] Dammit! Why isn't
the backup system kicking in?!

07:51.400 --> 07:52.736
[first officer] We're going to crash!

07:54.991 --> 07:56.744
[Sakuya gasps] What is this?

08:00.293 --> 08:02.130
The Situmpe Barrier?!

08:05.554 --> 08:07.015
-[alarms blaring]
-[grunts]

08:09.604 --> 08:11.440
Ash, status?

08:11.524 --> 08:12.651
[Ash] <i>No issues here.</i>

08:13.152 --> 08:15.532
The Situmpe Barrier
has me trapped all the way inland.

08:15.616 --> 08:19.122
<i>I can't get to you.
Will come up with a countermeasure ASAP.</i>

08:19.206 --> 08:20.249
[Ash] <i>Roger that.</i>

08:27.055 --> 08:29.434
[♪ ominous music crescendoes]

08:33.150 --> 08:34.486
[music ends]

08:42.836 --> 08:46.301
[Sakuya] <i>Why has the Situmpe Wall
extended all the way inland?</i>

08:47.053 --> 08:50.769
<i>At any rate,
I can't reach Norland like this.</i>

08:50.852 --> 08:53.148
<i>I need to find a way to break through...</i>

08:53.858 --> 08:57.658
<i>Should I start by destroying
the Situmpe Towers throughout Hokkaido?</i>

08:57.741 --> 08:58.868
<i>That's impossible now.</i>

08:58.952 --> 09:00.037
<i>In that case...</i>

09:00.539 --> 09:02.626
<i>I just need to secure the control device.</i>

09:02.710 --> 09:05.047
<i>It used to be managed by each region,</i>

09:05.757 --> 09:08.137
<i>but the system is likely different now...</i>

09:08.597 --> 09:11.561
<i>Change your approach,
shift your perspective!</i>

09:13.857 --> 09:15.234
Wait, isn't she...?!

09:18.073 --> 09:19.284
[Narah] I see...

09:19.869 --> 09:22.541
Norland is above the Situmpe Barrier.

09:23.125 --> 09:25.087
We can't reach him like this.

09:25.589 --> 09:28.511
Even if we were able
to deactivate the barrier,

09:28.595 --> 09:34.022
only a few Knightmare Frames in the world
can reach that altitude.

09:34.105 --> 09:37.863
Then what do we do?!
We're practically sitting ducks!

09:38.238 --> 09:40.661
There is one hope that remains...

09:40.744 --> 09:42.330
[knock on door, door opens]

09:42.581 --> 09:44.543
[Shizuka] Apologies for the interruption.

09:45.837 --> 09:48.425
Commander,
incoming transmission from Rozé.

09:48.927 --> 09:50.346
[Shiro] Is it a private line?

09:50.429 --> 09:53.561
He's requesting to speak
with the members here.

09:54.062 --> 09:55.106
[Shiro] Put him through.

09:55.189 --> 09:56.233
[Shizuka] Understood.

09:57.861 --> 09:59.573
<i>Is Narah Vaughn there?</i>

09:59.657 --> 10:02.078
<i>I need information on the Situmpe Towers.</i>

10:02.579 --> 10:04.290
Who the hell is he?

10:04.374 --> 10:06.796
[Shiro] Lady Vaughn, can you assist?

10:07.338 --> 10:08.591
[Narah] What do you want to know?

10:09.092 --> 10:11.514
<i>The location of the control device.</i>

10:11.597 --> 10:12.599
[Narah] For what purpose?

10:12.683 --> 10:15.647
To deactivate the barrier
and stop Norland.

10:15.730 --> 10:19.404
[Rozé] <i>Our Knightmares
should be able to fight at that altitude.</i>

10:21.951 --> 10:24.497
[Narah] The control room
is located on the top floor

10:25.082 --> 10:27.003
of the front shrine's main building.

10:27.086 --> 10:30.134
I'll send you the access codes
for the building's landing pads as well.

10:30.635 --> 10:32.430
[Rozé] Thank you, Lady Narah.

10:32.514 --> 10:35.311
[Narah] <i>I'm counting on you,
Nameless Mercenary.</i>

10:35.687 --> 10:36.689
Roger that.

10:37.900 --> 10:38.902
[Shiro] Shizuka.

10:39.194 --> 10:41.949
We'll also prepare for deployment.

10:42.033 --> 10:43.035
[Shizuka] Yes, sir.

10:43.118 --> 10:46.626
[Chairman] Look,
you can't just act on your own.

10:46.709 --> 10:50.842
I doubt the United Federation
of Nations will approve of this...

10:50.926 --> 10:53.765
-[comms device trills]
-[Kaguya] <i>I will persuade the Federation.</i>

10:55.267 --> 10:56.521
Chairwoman Kaguya!

10:57.438 --> 11:03.367
Let us put our faith
in that glimmer of hope.

11:05.454 --> 11:08.628
GOVERNMENT OFFICE FRONT SHRINE
MAIN BUILDING

11:21.946 --> 11:24.200
[Sakuya] <i>I promise I'll return to help.</i>

11:24.702 --> 11:26.079
<i>I need to hurry.</i>

11:27.081 --> 11:28.250
[gasps]

11:29.127 --> 11:30.672
-[automated voice] <i>Warning.</i>
-[alarm blaring]

11:30.755 --> 11:33.260
<i>Biometric authentication
of Norland von Lunebelg</i>

11:33.343 --> 11:35.180
<i>required to disable.</i>

11:35.682 --> 11:41.569
<i>Authenticate within three seconds.
Three, two, one.</i>

11:42.194 --> 11:43.823
<i>Maintenance program activated.</i>

11:44.407 --> 11:47.330
<i>Shutting down all power
in the front shrine.</i>

11:47.706 --> 11:49.000
You've gotta be kidding!

11:53.300 --> 11:54.845
[Sakuya] <i>Is this the end of the road?</i>

11:56.641 --> 11:59.772
<i>Without power, I can't even leave here...</i>

11:59.855 --> 12:01.776
[Yoko, over comms] <i>Can you hear me? Rozé?</i>

12:01.859 --> 12:03.780
[gasps] Ms. Araki?

12:06.326 --> 12:09.917
[Yoko] <i>General Kuroto, we're through
to Rozé! Transferring channel.</i>

12:10.877 --> 12:13.131
<i>This is Kuroto. Can you hear me, Rozé?</i>

12:13.633 --> 12:14.635
[Rozé] <i>Yes, sir!</i>

12:14.718 --> 12:17.641
The Seven Shining Stars
will arrive there soon.

12:17.724 --> 12:19.978
We want to assist
in deactivating the barrier.

12:20.479 --> 12:21.941
[Rozé] <i>How did you find me?!</i>

12:22.400 --> 12:24.487
[Kuroto] <i>The Black Knights informed us.</i>

12:25.030 --> 12:28.245
<i>Every member of the Stars
volunteered to come assist you.</i>

12:29.623 --> 12:34.090
[Rozé] <i>Thank you, guys.
You're absolute lifesavers.</i>

12:34.633 --> 12:37.221
So, what can we start with?

12:37.639 --> 12:40.812
[Rozé] I've got just the thing
I could use your help with...

12:43.025 --> 12:44.193
[Yoko] <i>General Kuroto.</i>

12:44.277 --> 12:47.784
<i>Visuals confirm a significant number
of Loki around the perimeter.</i>

12:47.868 --> 12:49.037
[Kuroto] <i>Roger that.</i>

12:50.497 --> 12:53.462
It's going to be tough
with our current forces...

12:54.798 --> 12:58.723
<i>We will now commence the operation
to restore power to the front shrine.</i>

12:59.725 --> 13:03.273
Diversion teams Bravo, Charlie, and Delta,

13:03.356 --> 13:05.277
deploy to your designated positions.

13:05.360 --> 13:06.446
[soldiers] <i>Roger that!</i>

13:06.530 --> 13:09.912
[Kuroto] <i>The main force will stand by
at Point Alpha on the perimeter.</i>

13:09.995 --> 13:11.582
<i>Wait for the route to be secured.</i>

13:11.665 --> 13:13.460
[Isao] <i>Main force,
ready to deploy at any time.</i>

13:13.544 --> 13:16.257
[Kuroto] <i>Diversion teams,
commence operation.</i>

13:16.341 --> 13:17.468
[soldiers] <i>Roger that!</i>

13:25.777 --> 13:27.656
[Tsutsuya] <i>All right, let's do this!</i>

13:27.739 --> 13:28.741
[soldier 1] <i>Yes, sir!</i>

13:30.035 --> 13:32.206
[Ishikawa] <i>Hey, over here!</i>

13:32.289 --> 13:33.626
[Toriba] <i>Let's drop here!</i>

13:33.709 --> 13:36.172
<i>Draw in as many Loki as you can!</i>

13:36.256 --> 13:37.258
[soldiers] <i>Yes, sir!</i>

13:40.640 --> 13:41.642
[Toriba] <i>Fukai!</i>

13:42.184 --> 13:43.186
<i>Damn it!</i>

13:44.230 --> 13:45.399
[Yoko] Charlie down one.

13:45.482 --> 13:47.612
But the main force's route is clear.

13:47.696 --> 13:48.739
<i>We can proceed!</i>

13:48.823 --> 13:50.033
Main force, advance!

13:50.117 --> 13:51.286
[Isao] <i>Roger that!</i>

13:58.008 --> 13:59.176
Damn!

13:59.260 --> 14:00.304
[Amami] <i>They got me!</i>

14:02.893 --> 14:03.895
[Isao] <i>Haruka!</i>

14:04.688 --> 14:07.192
If the leader of the charge
stops in a situation like this,

14:07.276 --> 14:10.742
it halts the whole unit
and puts everyone in danger.

14:10.825 --> 14:11.994
[Haruka] <i>Sorry, but--</i>

14:12.077 --> 14:13.789
[Isao] <i>You're second-in-command now.</i>

14:14.206 --> 14:15.543
Take responsibility.

14:16.044 --> 14:18.507
<i>That's the duty of a leader.</i>

14:19.008 --> 14:20.010
<i>Let's go.</i>

14:20.845 --> 14:21.847
[Haruka] <i>Understood...</i>

14:27.734 --> 14:29.529
[Isao] <i>We're about to reach the center.</i>

14:30.113 --> 14:31.282
<i>Any activity there?</i>

14:31.366 --> 14:32.786
Nothing so far...

14:33.286 --> 14:34.831
No, hang on a second!

14:34.915 --> 14:37.545
[Yoko] Multiple Loki have appeared
around the breach point!

14:38.088 --> 14:39.215
[Isao] <i>What?</i>

14:42.388 --> 14:45.310
[Oda] <i>You've gotta be kidding.
They knew we were coming...</i>

14:45.394 --> 14:47.481
[Shota] <i>They're always one step
ahead of us...</i>

14:47.565 --> 14:50.278
[Oda] <i>We can't just jump in there
and set up the breaching charges.</i>

14:50.362 --> 14:51.364
<i>There's no way!</i>

14:51.447 --> 14:53.118
[Haruka] <i>So, should we
just turn tail and run?</i>

14:53.201 --> 14:54.997
[Shota] <i>That's not gonna work either.</i>

14:55.540 --> 14:58.671
[Isao] <i>Someone's gotta do it... right?</i>

15:04.098 --> 15:06.436
I'll be off, then.

15:31.360 --> 15:32.362
<i>All right.</i>

15:32.947 --> 15:34.910
<i>Now I just need to wait
for them to gather.</i>

15:34.993 --> 15:36.705
[Haruka] <i>Captain Monobe,
what're you doing?!</i>

15:36.789 --> 15:38.124
Creating a breach.

15:38.208 --> 15:39.293
[Haruka] <i>Wait, but--</i>

15:39.376 --> 15:40.963
[Isao] <i>There's no time for discussions.</i>

15:41.715 --> 15:45.807
<i>At times like this,
someone's got to take action.</i>

15:51.484 --> 15:54.574
<i>Hang in there a little longer, Sekka.</i>

15:55.952 --> 15:56.954
[Kuroto] <i>Monobe.</i>

15:59.083 --> 16:01.212
You have my deepest gratitude.

16:02.339 --> 16:04.678
[Isao] I have no regrets, General Kuroto.

16:12.234 --> 16:13.571
No...

16:21.460 --> 16:22.672
<i>His sword...</i>

16:23.423 --> 16:27.431
Take responsibility.
That's the duty of a leader.

16:31.314 --> 16:34.445
[Haruka] <i>The path is clear.
Let's move forward!</i>

16:34.529 --> 16:37.159
[♪ dramatic music playing]

16:40.457 --> 16:42.921
[Kuroto] <i>Haruka, what's your status?</i>

16:43.379 --> 16:45.551
[Haruka]
We've just reached the final unit.

16:48.139 --> 16:50.310
This should restore power.

16:53.734 --> 16:55.738
[powering up]

16:58.117 --> 16:59.328
[Rozé] <i>Thank you.</i>

17:00.038 --> 17:01.833
[Kuroto] <i>Proceed with your mission.</i>

17:02.084 --> 17:03.211
Roger that.

17:03.963 --> 17:07.219
[Sakuya] <i>According to the data,
the barrier's output is near its limit.</i>

17:07.804 --> 17:11.812
<i>I can use the console to create a surge...</i>

17:12.647 --> 17:14.149
<i>If I can't stop it,</i>

17:15.151 --> 17:16.404
<i>I'll overload the system</i>

17:17.657 --> 17:18.659
<i>and fry it!</i>

17:18.742 --> 17:21.748
[♪ dramatic music swells]

17:33.897 --> 17:35.108
What the hell is going on?

17:35.610 --> 17:38.824
The Situmpe Barrier
in the fourth sector has begun to vanish.

17:39.158 --> 17:41.747
[Black Knight member] <i>Situmpe Towers
27 through 30.</i>

17:41.830 --> 17:42.832
<i>No response!</i>

17:47.007 --> 17:48.802
[Yoko] <i>The aerial barrier has vanished!</i>

17:49.512 --> 17:51.975
[Shota] <i>Looks like Rozé's mission
was a success.</i>

17:52.059 --> 17:53.061
[Oda] <i>Hell yeah.</i>

17:53.854 --> 17:56.359
[Hinagata gasps] <i>This ain't good.</i>

17:56.442 --> 17:57.654
[Oda] <i>What's wrong, Hinagata?</i>

17:58.112 --> 17:59.699
[Hinagata] <i>The Loki keep coming...</i>

18:00.033 --> 18:01.035
[Shota gasps]

18:01.745 --> 18:04.542
[Shota] <i>We may not make it out alive...</i>

18:05.377 --> 18:07.047
[Oda] <i>These numbers are no joke...</i>

18:07.130 --> 18:09.051
[Kosaka] <i>I don't want to die here.</i>

18:13.769 --> 18:15.271
[Walther] <i>It's a pleasure to meet you.</i>

18:16.232 --> 18:18.111
We are here to lend our support.

18:19.488 --> 18:22.244
<i>To all Neo-Britannian forces.</i>

18:23.496 --> 18:27.755
Cooperate with the Seven Shining Stars
to eliminate the Loki.

18:29.466 --> 18:31.220
This is an imperial order.

18:32.055 --> 18:37.775
Norland von Lunebelg is now a traitor
to our nation and a threat to humanity.

18:37.859 --> 18:41.783
We will show him... our true strength!

18:56.980 --> 18:58.901
The barrier is down.

18:59.819 --> 19:01.489
This is the end of the road for you.

19:02.617 --> 19:06.875
[Norland] <i>The barrier was just to buy time
to advance my plan.</i>

19:07.668 --> 19:11.258
<i>The Situmpe system
is also built into this Foulbout,</i>

19:12.512 --> 19:16.477
and the base unit
has its own independent energy system.

19:17.103 --> 19:21.696
Existing systems are powerless against me.

19:23.157 --> 19:27.583
<i>In other words,
you will never achieve victory.</i>

19:30.631 --> 19:32.133
[Rozé] <i>I'll be off, then.</i>

19:33.846 --> 19:36.935
[Sakura] <i>This is the best
I can do right now.</i>

19:37.854 --> 19:39.899
<i>I leave the rest to you.</i>

19:43.322 --> 19:44.324
[Ash] <i>Norland.</i>

19:45.870 --> 19:47.707
I will defeat you with my own hands!

19:48.416 --> 19:49.711
[beeping]

19:51.673 --> 19:53.677
[♪ upbeat rock music playing]

20:19.269 --> 20:20.564
Hmm.

20:21.273 --> 20:23.110
[Norland] <i>It would appear</i>

20:23.194 --> 20:26.200
<i>that staying here is a waste of my time.</i>

20:27.118 --> 20:29.373
<i>I will turn the tide of this battle.</i>

20:35.176 --> 20:36.178
[scoffs]

20:36.261 --> 20:39.101
[Norland] <i>I know your fighting style
inside and out.</i>

20:39.686 --> 20:42.566
No matter what you do,
you can't defeat me.

20:58.014 --> 20:59.767
This will end it...

21:03.984 --> 21:05.278
[Ash] <i>If I don't take this hit...</i>

21:06.071 --> 21:07.490
<i>I have a chance to win!</i>

21:25.318 --> 21:27.322
[Knightmare powering down]

21:45.274 --> 21:46.276
[Norland] It's over.

21:47.530 --> 21:49.784
Now vanish from my sight.

